{"id":"wb-5-248","name":"广仁王庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广仁王庙","text":"广仁王庙又称五龙庙，位于中华人民共和国山西省芮城县城北的古魏镇中龙泉村，毗邻永乐宫现址。正殿建于唐大和六年（832年），是中国现存三座完整唐代木构建筑中第二古老的，仅次于五台县南禅寺大殿（782年），2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n广仁王庙为民间用于祈雨的龙王庙。其庙内供奉龙泉之神“广仁王”。因殿前土坡下原有五龙泉水前涌出，故当地群众也俗称其为“五龙庙”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E4%BB%81%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":91515697,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91515697","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1ff6e75ac7cc51193df0332d.jpg","title":"芮城广仁王庙2018（2）.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8A%AE%E5%9F%8E%E5%B9%BF%E4%BB%81%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%992018%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/%E8%8A%AE%E5%9F%8E%E5%B9%BF%E4%BB%81%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%992018%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Five Dragons Temple, Ruicheng County, Yuncheng","width":320,"height":206}}